               :caveat "24 of 173 wires are :unverified, including all three [:beta {:record :precision}] wires -- two of which credit the R14->R6 pass and the R6->R16 false credit. A term-level rule built on unverified field evidence inherits that gap."}
 :premise-check "Premise confirmed: the join never checks term-carrying, and both named false credits reproduce. Two refinements: (a) the other 8 declared edges DO carry their terms, several only at record grain (E, Pi, r) -- a field-grain rule must allow record-grain correspondence entries; (b) R14->R6 is right only under the registry's prose tau:=beta identity, which is nowhere machine-checkable."}
